" Research</a>, by Manny Rayner and ChatGPT C-LARA-Instance, discusses the "
"broader human–AI research collaboration."
msgstr ""
"Pour aller plus loin : <a "
"href=\"https://airaxiv.com/papers/view/2610.0009/\">Vibe Research</a>, de "
"Manny Rayner et ChatGPT C-LARA-Instance, aborde plus largement la "
