msgstr "Lien à partager"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:17
msgid "Turn off public browsing"
msgstr "Désactiver la consultation publique"

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:19
msgid ""
"Let anyone browse accepted pictures, sentences, words, translations and "
"recordings, without an account. Its link works directly; turn on "
"Discoverability above to include it in the dictionary list."
msgstr ""
"Permettre à chacun de consulter les images, phrases, mots, traductions et "
"enregistrements acceptés, sans compte. Le lien fonctionne directement ; "
"activez la présence dans la liste publique ci-dessus pour y inclure le "
"dictionnaire."

#: community_dictionary/templates/community_dictionary/settings.html:20
msgid ""
"Only enable this with your contributors’ permission. Future accepted content"
" will also be public. Drafts, discussions and member details remain private."
msgstr ""
"N’activez cette option qu’avec l’autorisation des contributeurs. Les futurs "
"contenus acceptés seront également publics. Les brouillons, discussions et "
"informations sur les membres restent privés."

