"Hide an older or unused dictionary to keep the main list clear for everyone."
" Members can still find it under Hidden dictionaries or open a saved link. "
"Hiding also turns off discoverability and public browsing; making it visible"
" again does not turn either back on. Content and contribution rights are "
"unchanged."
